{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53137","headline":"三言重拟五杂俎 · 皎然","name":"三言重拟五杂俎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五杂俎，箧中线。\n往复还，双飞燕。\n不得已，长门怨。\n（昼。\n下缺。\n见同书卷十。\n）（按：原诗应爲与颜真卿等联句，今仅存皎然之作。\n又按：《全唐诗》卷七九四联句《秋日潘述自长城至霅上……》第十句皎然诗缺一字。\n明刻本《吴兴艺文补》卷四三录此诗不缺，此句爲「懽敍难兼遂」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}